        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Dreamfall Chapters is an episodic, story-driven adventure game about choices and consequences, dreams and reality, magic and science, chaos and order, and the broken heroes whose actions will shape the course of history in all worlds. With a brand new storyline, Dreamfall Chapters introduces new players to The Longest Journey Saga, while returning players will get the conclusion they have been waiting for ever since the end of Dreamfall: The Longest Journey.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Dreamfall Chapters es un videojuego de aventuras episódico y centrado en la historia, sobre decisiones y consecuencias, sueños y realidad, magia y ciencia, caos y orden, y los héroes rotos cuyas acciones darán forma al curso de la historia en todos los mundos. Con una trama completamente nueva, Dreamfall Chapters presenta la saga The Longest Journey a los jugadores nuevos, mientras que quienes ya la conocen recibirán el desenlace que esperaban desde el final de Dreamfall: The Longest Journey.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
